TITLE 1D cation exchange transport
SOLUTION 0
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
SOLUTION 1-10
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
SOLUTION 11
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X- 0.001
    -equilibrate 1
USE solution 0
USE exchange 1
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -length 10
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -dispersivities 0
    -print_cells 1-10
    -print_frequency 1
    -punch_cells 1-10
    -punch_frequency 1
    -injection_solution 11
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file transport.sel
    -reset false
    -time true
    -solution true
USER_PUNCH
    -head step cell CaX2
10  PUNCH -STEP_NO, LX, MOL("CaX2")/TOT("X")